# Dual-Surface Design System & Navigation Rules
- **Player Surface (`/`):** Read `@design/player/` first. Do not use DaisyUI, `daisyui`, or Daisy semantic classes (`btn`, `card`, `badge`, `tabs`, `progress`, `modal`, `table`). Style pages with Tailwind utility classes copied from the Stitch HTML, plus one shared stylesheet, `public/styles/neon-tokyo.css`. That file is extracted from `@design/player/*/code.html`: keep `.cyber-grid`, `.neon-glow-pink`, and `.neon-glow-cyan` verbatim, and carry the Stitch color tokens and font stacks (`Sora` headlines, `Space Grotesk` labels, `Inter` body). Set `data-theme="taproom"` on `<html>`. Theme variables match Neon Tokyo (`#050811` / `#0a0a12` canvas, `#0c101c` / `#141422` cards, `#ff2d78` primary neon pink, `#00ffcc` cyan telemetry, `#9d4edd` / `#ffe04a` tertiary accents).
- **Auth-Aware Brand Logo:** The `PUB QUIZ` logo in the top header MUST link to `/` (Landing/Gateway) when unauthenticated and `/dashboard` (Player Dashboard) when logged in.
- **Static Legal Pages (FR-12):** Never render Terms & Conditions or Privacy Policy as a modal. Footer links (`TERMS & CONDITIONS`, `PRIVACY POLICY`) MUST route to dedicated server/templated static content pages (`/terms` and `/privacy`) modeled on `@design/player/static_content/code.html` (backed by configurable static content storage so the future Admin Portal can edit them).
- **Admin Surface (`/admin`):** Use `[data-theme="admin"]` (white `#ffffff` canvas, `#f8fafc` slate sidebar/tables, `#4f46e5` primary actions) and read `@design/admin/` when present.
- **Components:** Build player components with Tailwind utilities and the classes in `public/styles/neon-tokyo.css` only. Keep layouts mobile-first (390px) and desktop-ready (1440px). The future admin surface may use its own stylesheet; it still must not pull DaisyUI into player pages.
